title: $:/changenotes/5.5.0/#10077
description: tm-modal can give the modal every variable of the widget that sent it
release: 5.5.0
tags: $:/tags/ChangeNote
change-type: enhancement
change-category: hackability
github-links: https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5/pull/10077
github-contributors: Davien21
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* A `tm-modal` message with `inheritvariables` set to ''yes'' or ''true'' gives the modal every variable the sending widget can see, including procedures, functions and the toolbar settings from the page template, so toolbar buttons in a modal can show their icons and text (fixes [[Issue #10057|https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5/issues/10057]])
